# Moddy Arena: the same make aimed OUTSIDE the arena (at the prep room's floor behind him) is refused by the reach rule,
# and nothing is built there.
@intent a player in Moddy Arena aims a make at the prep room's floor, outside the arena, and it is refused
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s

@step aim at the prep room floor
# from the arrival spot, turned round (south, yaw 0) and looking down at the planks behind him
@aim look 0 35
@wait 1s
@shot aiming-at-the-prep-room

@step the Apprentice offers a house
moddy apprentice a cozy house
@expect screen Container within 10s

@step he presses the top tile and it is refused
@click slot 0
@expect chat /didn't work this time/ within 90s
@wait 2s
# the prep room is as it was: plank floor behind him, clear air above it, the room behind the start button still empty air (compared with the empty sky at y 200)
@assert execute if block 0 63 24 minecraft:oak_planks
@assert execute if block 0 64 24 minecraft:air
@assert execute if blocks -4 64 18 4 67 25 -4 200 18 all
@shot refused
